# The language files were ignored wholesale because LanguageHelper generates
# them. That was true when each held ten template keys; it stopped being true the
# moment the panel's own 734 translations went into ar.json.
#
# They are the product's copy — the words a customer and an operator actually
# read — and copy belongs in version control. An ignored ar.json is a translation
# that survives on one developer's machine and nowhere else.
*
!.gitignore
!*.json
